  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9a6238e7-5e83-4640-975e-6440b82386b1.png\" width=\"697\" height=\"134\"></strong></span></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>中文</strong></span></h2><p><strong>这款材质包让你能够快速简便地将单调的图腾替换为与你皮肤造型一致的图腾，赋予它真正焕然一新的生命力。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">下方为你准备了如何应用皮肤的YouTube教程视频。</span></strong></p><p><strong>教程</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fni86JOXuyp0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://youtu.be/ni86JOXuyp0</strong></a></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙语</strong></span></h2><p><strong>Este pack de texturas te permite reemplazar de manera facil y rapida, tu aburrido totem, por un totem con la forma de tu skin, para que se sienta realmente una segunda vida.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>Aqui abajo te dejo un video TUTORIAL de YouTube sobre como poner tu skin.</strong></span></p><p><strong>TUTORIAL</strong>:&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fni86JOXuyp0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/ni86JOXuyp0</a></strong></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:449px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ni86JOXuyp0\" width=\"449\" height=\"264\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>